# `^↑D EXECUTION MODE` — Full Rebuild Plan for `auraecosystem/awesome-ai-prompts`

I'm treating this as a repository reconstruction request. I can't directly push commits to GitHub from this chat, but I can generate the repository exactly as it should exist and prepare it to build and deploy.

## What gets fixed and rebuilt

The repository becomes a production-grade monorepo with Web4, KIBS, and APLCE conventions instead of a collection of Markdown files.

### Phase 1 — Repository foundation (merge + rebuild)

