### Phase 2 — Monorepo architecture

```
awesome-ai-prompts/
├── apps/
│   ├── docs/                 # Next.js documentation
│   ├── gallery/              # Live prompt gallery
│   ├── playground/           # Prompt playground
│   └── api/                  # API server
├── packages/
│   ├── prompt-engine/
│   ├── parser/
│   ├── renderer/
│   ├── sdk-js/
│   ├── sdk-python/
│   ├── sdk-rust/
│   ├── search/
│   ├── embeddings/
│   └── ui/
├── prompts/
├── translations/
├── schemas/
├── docs/
├── assets/
├── scripts/
├── tests/
└── .github/workflows/
```

### Phase 3 — Prompt language (`.aprompt`)

I'll create a real prompt specification instead of plain Markdown.

YAML

```
---
id: aura.ui.watch.hero
provider: [lmlm, gpt5-mini, gemini]
category: [ui, threejs]
difficulty: advanced
variables:
  brand: Aura
  framework: Next.js
---
Create a premium luxury landing page...
```

Also included:

* JSON Schema.

* ANTLR grammar (`AuraPrompt.g4`).

* Tree-sitter grammar.

* VS Code syntax highlighting.

